# 12V DC to 220V AC Inverter Using SG3525A

## Project Overview

This project focuses on designing and assembling a DC-to-AC inverter that converts a 12V DC input into an AC output using an SG3525A PWM controller, IRF520 MOSFETs, and a 12-0-12V transformer.

The project demonstrates the practical application of power electronics, PWM generation, MOSFET switching, transformer operation, and DC-to-AC power conversion.

## Objectives

- Convert a 12V DC input into an AC output.
- Generate switching pulses using the SG3525A PWM controller.
- Implement a push-pull switching configuration using IRF520 MOSFETs.
- Understand transformer-based voltage conversion.
- Observe output-voltage variation under different load conditions.

## Hardware Components

- 12V DC power supply
- SG3525A PWM controller
- Two IRF520 MOSFETs
- 12-0-12V transformer (1A)
- Supporting electronic components
- Connecting wires and circuit assembly components

